<title>CANADA: Placer Dome to raise funds, takes charge.</title>
<headline>Placer Dome to raise funds, takes charge.</headline>
<dateline>VANCVOUVER 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placer Dome Inc. said on Thursday that it planned to raise funds through the sale of some assets and the issue of preferred securities.</p>
<p>The gold company said in a statement that it will also re-evaluate two of its properties.</p>
<p>As a result, Placer Dome said it will record a US$78 million after-tax charge against earnings in the fourth quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to raise US$300 million through the sale of preferred shares with a term of 49 years.</p>
<p>Placer said it wants to focus on its core gold holdings.</p>
</text>
